<Slide style={{width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '0px', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei'}}><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 72, background: '#1E4FA8'}}></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 72, paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 28, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>方法总览：选择缩空间 → MUAS 精优化 → 滚动闭环</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#C9DCF7', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>02 方法 · 总体框架</Text></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 88, left: 60, width: 1160, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 9}}><Box style={{width: 1160, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 15, gap: 9}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>总体框架：任务池 → 选择缩空间 → MUAS 精优化 → 执行反馈 → 闭环回池</Text><Box style={{width: 1120, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 9}}><Box style={{width: 240, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 9, gap: 4}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>输入</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>任务池 T_t + 机队状态</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>新到 ∪ 滞留 ∪ 故障释放；位置 / 剩余航程 / 可用性</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 24, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'center' }}>→</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 240, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 9, gap: 4}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>①</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>阶段一 · 选择</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>n_cand 候选 → n_sel 已选集 S，cap(t) 卡规模</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 24, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'center' }}>→</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 240, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 9, gap: 4}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>②</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>阶段二 · MUAS</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>选机 → DMDE → 修复链 → 终点巢 → polish</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 24, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'center' }}>→</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 240, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 9, gap: 4}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>输出</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>交付解 + 滚动写回</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>航次（任务序列 + 终点巢）+ 诊断量</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 1120, background: '#E8EFF8', paddingLeft: 13, justifyContent: 'center', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 11}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>↩</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>滚动写回：完成出池 · 未选留池 · 故障释放 · 新任务入池 · 机队位置与航程更新 → 下一周期重算</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 1160, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', gap: 12}}><Box style={{width: 376, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 12, gap: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>缩空间 · 第一阶段</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, textAlign: 'left' }}>只对「值得考虑的任务」排序筛选，落选留池下周期再评；避免对整个动态任务池做昂贵组合搜索。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 376, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 12, gap: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>精优化 · 第二阶段</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, textAlign: 'left' }}>四类决策联合优化：起点固定、终点可选的多机巢 MTSP 变体；交付后再做只接受严格改进的成本 polish。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 376, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 12, gap: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>闭环 · 滚动层</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, textAlign: 'left' }}>每周期独立重算选择与分配，状态只经执行反馈演化；迟到不等于废飞，长程运行不丢任务。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 1160, background: '#E8EFF8', paddingLeft: 15, paddingRight: 15, paddingTop: 9, paddingBottom: 9, justifyContent: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, textAlign: 'left' }}>代码入口：selection/pipeline.py → muas/solvers/stage_runner.py → rolling/horizon.py。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 670, left: 60, width: 1160, height: 30, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>动态滚动的多机巢多无人机协同任务分配 · 方法讲解</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>07 / 19</Text></Box></Slide>